WEBVTT

00:00:02.912 --> 00:00:09.331
As a result of Eliza's and Neil's
prank, Candy was labeled a thief.

00:00:10.312 --> 00:00:13.750
I can't put up with thieves
in Leagan family!

00:00:13.928 --> 00:00:19.057
And so they decided to send
Candy to Mexico.

00:00:20.137 --> 00:00:27.090
Departure to an unknown country.

00:00:30.859 --> 00:00:33.199
Good morning, Caesar, Cleopatra!

00:00:36.717 --> 00:00:39.934
I still don't know on which day
will they send me to Mexico.

00:00:42.076 --> 00:00:45.317
But I'll take good care of you
until that day, so don't worry.

00:01:03.024 --> 00:01:04.100
Candy!

00:01:04.388 --> 00:01:05.149
Yes?

00:01:08.138 --> 00:01:09.700
What is it?

00:01:09.801 --> 00:01:13.420
You'll be leaving tomorrow
in the morning. Got it?

00:01:13.455 --> 00:01:15.003
In the morning?

00:01:16.966 --> 00:01:19.042
You haven't packed up yet, haven't you?

00:01:19.258 --> 00:01:20.656
No, not yet...

00:01:20.877 --> 00:01:24.136
Then, pack up quickly.
That way you won't be in a hurry.

00:01:28.995 --> 00:01:31.442
We're finally parting, Candy.

00:01:31.477 --> 00:01:33.687
We'll really miss you!

00:01:34.451 --> 00:01:35.716
Don't come back!

00:01:37.608 --> 00:01:40.912
Tommorrow morning... to Mexico.

00:01:49.328 --> 00:01:52.436
No matter how fast I'm running...
it's much too soon.

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:57.337
Anthony, at least,
I'd like to say goodbye to you.

00:02:03.552 --> 00:02:06.210
I'll have to part from these
rose gates, too.

00:02:06.679 --> 00:02:09.329
What a wonderful smell!

00:02:09.517 --> 00:02:11.760
I won't forget it!

00:02:28.809 --> 00:02:30.052
Anthony!

00:02:30.872 --> 00:02:33.007
Hey, Anthony!

00:02:33.246 --> 00:02:34.934
Hello, Stear, Archie!

00:02:37.839 --> 00:02:40.177
Working the garden, as usual?

00:02:41.937 --> 00:02:45.168
Anthony, what was the name
of this rose again?

00:02:45.317 --> 00:02:46.177
It's a new kind.

00:02:46.181 --> 00:02:47.552
Can I take one?

00:02:47.859 --> 00:02:49.244
I like Candy to have one.

00:02:52.177 --> 00:02:54.555
Archie, you can't take any
of these.

00:02:54.982 --> 00:02:56.650
I already gave one to Candy.

00:02:57.087 --> 00:02:58.684
I see, you already did...

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:00.460
What?!

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:02.150
Anthony, when did you...?

00:03:02.299 --> 00:03:04.410
These roses are called
"Sweet Candy".

00:03:04.585 --> 00:03:06.563
"Sweet Candy"?

00:03:06.956 --> 00:03:08.887
I named them after Candy.

00:03:09.888 --> 00:03:12.569
Why, you!
Don'cha joke with us!

00:03:23.094 --> 00:03:25.662
No, no, Kurin!
Be quiet!

00:03:28.037 --> 00:03:29.126
Stop that!

00:03:33.524 --> 00:03:34.663
Aunt!

00:03:35.612 --> 00:03:37.743
I have something to say to you.

00:03:38.724 --> 00:03:40.301
What happened, aunt?

00:03:40.526 --> 00:03:44.068
You must not approach Candy.
Got it?

00:03:44.103 --> 00:03:45.479
Why?

00:03:45.676 --> 00:03:48.679
That girl stole from the Leagans.

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:52.173
Candy... stole?

00:03:52.584 --> 00:03:53.455
Yes.

00:03:53.949 --> 00:03:55.938
No!
That's a lie!

00:03:55.973 --> 00:03:57.718
That's nonsense!

00:03:57.777 --> 00:04:00.024
That's not true!
Are you certain?

00:04:00.169 --> 00:04:03.222
That's right!
There's no way she'd ever do that.

00:04:03.225 --> 00:04:04.501
Be quiet!

00:04:04.724 --> 00:04:08.033
As a leader of the Adley family,
this is my decision.

00:04:08.042 --> 00:04:10.651
You must not approach her!
I'm ordering you!

00:04:17.206 --> 00:04:20.386
Aunt! I won't listen to your
orders anymore!

00:04:20.483 --> 00:04:21.579
Hey, Anthony.

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:24.343
Don't say things you don't
know anything about!

00:04:24.378 --> 00:04:25.423
Anthony!

00:04:25.458 --> 00:04:29.486
What's gotten into you? You've
never opposed me before.

00:04:29.521 --> 00:04:31.562
It must be that Candy's doing...

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:34.230
No, you're wrong!

00:04:34.265 --> 00:04:35.720
It was my own decision.

00:04:35.755 --> 00:04:37.756
Aunt, I'm mad!

00:04:38.305 --> 00:04:40.356
Oh, my!

00:04:42.135 --> 00:04:43.255
I'm going back!

00:04:44.923 --> 00:04:49.715
-Anthony, you've...
-You've angered Aunt over Candy.

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:52.945
I've got to do something...
If I don't prove her innocence...

00:04:53.645 --> 00:04:57.575
Anthony, you mustn't anger your aunt.

00:04:57.615 --> 00:05:01.921
I'd be content if you just
believed that I'm not a thief.

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:05.164
I'll be heading to Mexico tomorrow.

00:05:05.447 --> 00:05:07.906
I'll write you every day
until I come back.

00:05:07.941 --> 00:05:10.137
And I won't forget about
Archie and Stear.

00:05:12.609 --> 00:05:14.750
You need to live in harmony
with your aunt.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:15.874
Farewell!

00:05:19.773 --> 00:05:20.848
Candy!

00:05:23.085 --> 00:05:25.854
She must have seen everything.

00:05:26.399 --> 00:05:27.307
Candy!

00:05:28.379 --> 00:05:30.616
-Candy!
-Candy!

00:05:31.687 --> 00:05:33.174
Candy!

00:05:47.961 --> 00:05:51.717
-Candy!
-Miss tomboy!

00:05:51.752 --> 00:05:54.882
She's upset because Aunt
said bad things about her.

00:05:56.489 --> 00:05:58.454
Candy!

00:06:00.998 --> 00:06:04.492
Farewell! Thank you for giving
me these fond memories!

00:06:04.658 --> 00:06:06.283
Farewell, Anthony!

00:06:29.644 --> 00:06:30.835
This is enough.

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:35.485
This beautiful forest and the lake,
they're in my memory now.

00:06:35.798 --> 00:06:37.093
Now, let's go, Kurin.

00:06:50.887 --> 00:06:54.445
Do you know what's Adley property
in Mexico alike?

00:06:54.754 --> 00:06:55.609
I know a little.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:57.978
It's a horrible place.

00:07:00.039 --> 00:07:03.308
Work is much harder there.

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:12.062
Also, bandits sometimes attack the property.
It's a horrible place, I'm telling you.

00:07:12.129 --> 00:07:14.617
And they're sending Candy to such a place...

00:07:15.208 --> 00:07:17.369
Madam is so cruel!

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:20.374
The property in Mexico is
such a place...

00:07:27.349 --> 00:07:31.325
Sister Pony...
What should I do?

00:07:32.409 --> 00:07:37.791
Candy, you're a strong girl who
always cleared the path for herself.

00:07:37.826 --> 00:07:39.046
You'll be okay.

00:07:39.242 --> 00:07:41.859
No! I don't want to go to Mexico!

00:07:44.851 --> 00:07:45.984
Kurin.

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:50.957
-Candy?
-Dorothy!

00:07:50.992 --> 00:07:53.305
Everybody is waiting for you.

00:07:53.776 --> 00:07:55.010
Come soon.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:07:59.777
Waiting for me?

00:08:00.851 --> 00:08:04.702
Candy.
I didn't have the power to stop them.

00:08:05.972 --> 00:08:09.239
I'm so sorry for that.
Please, forgive me.

00:08:09.274 --> 00:08:10.520
It's okay!

00:08:10.555 --> 00:08:14.994
I'm so happy; my friends made
a farewell party in my honour!

00:08:16.515 --> 00:08:19.407
We couldn't make it loud, because
Madam would give us hell for that.

00:08:19.626 --> 00:08:21.740
That's why we did everything in secret.

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:23.139
Eat plenty!

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:25.595
Thank you, Doug.

00:08:25.942 --> 00:08:27.427
Thank you, everybody!

00:08:53.773 --> 00:08:57.369
Hey, Mary, haven't you
promised that you wouldn't...

00:08:58.182 --> 00:08:59.519
I'm sorry!

00:09:13.711 --> 00:09:15.201
Don't cry, everybody!

00:09:15.787 --> 00:09:18.747
No matter where I might end up,
I'll be just fine!

00:09:18.782 --> 00:09:21.502
It's exactly like mr. Hoittman said!

00:09:34.902 --> 00:09:38.739
I'm sure Candy will do just fine!

00:09:40.291 --> 00:09:42.096
Candy!

00:09:42.131 --> 00:09:44.664
You look so serious...!

00:09:47.001 --> 00:09:48.269
Do I?

00:09:59.415 --> 00:10:02.847
Candy...
If you're really going to Mexico...

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:07.798
Candy!
I'll never let you go away!

00:10:10.011 --> 00:10:12.945
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
This is a free fansub. Not for sale,
rent or auction!

00:10:13.258 --> 00:10:15.164
Candy, hang in there!

00:10:15.199 --> 00:10:17.216
Do you best, Candy.

00:10:17.251 --> 00:10:18.608
Thank you very much!

00:10:18.745 --> 00:10:21.585
-Good night!
-Good night.

00:10:31.774 --> 00:10:32.553
Huh?

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.940
This is... Sweet Candy?

00:10:38.664 --> 00:10:42.382
Anthony... Anthony must
have brought them.

00:10:43.018 --> 00:10:44.466
What's this note?

00:10:47.428 --> 00:10:51.986
Candy. Please forgive aunt Elroy.

00:10:52.021 --> 00:10:57.843
I'll do everything I can for your sake.
You do your best, too!

00:11:00.439 --> 00:11:01.696
Anthony!

00:11:05.186 --> 00:11:07.314
-Candy is...
-To Mexico?

00:11:07.522 --> 00:11:10.327
Aunt! Why didn't you tell
us about this?

00:11:10.542 --> 00:11:13.266
You'd make a lot of noise if
I told you.

00:11:13.656 --> 00:11:15.005
Of course!

00:11:15.161 --> 00:11:18.520
Why are you sending her to
such a faraway place?

00:11:18.573 --> 00:11:22.450
Aunt, please! Reconsider
this decision!

00:11:25.245 --> 00:11:26.636
I can't do that.

00:11:26.671 --> 00:11:28.872
That girl is a thief.

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:31.589
Candy would never do such a thing!

00:11:33.367 --> 00:11:35.467
I saw it with my own eyes!

00:11:35.502 --> 00:11:40.461
Eliza pulled her family's belongings
from Candy's baggage!

00:11:44.021 --> 00:11:45.025
Neil!

00:11:45.641 --> 00:11:49.754
Aunt, Candy is not someone who
would steal from other people!

00:11:49.789 --> 00:11:51.296
I'm going to prove it!

00:11:55.676 --> 00:11:58.042
Hey! Wait, Anthony!

00:11:58.735 --> 00:12:00.091
Anthony.

00:12:12.284 --> 00:12:13.831
Sorry.

00:12:34.494 --> 00:12:35.193
Neil!

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:36.303
Neil!

00:12:40.787 --> 00:12:43.902
Neil, you set up Candy for stealing?

00:12:46.815 --> 00:12:47.828
You won't get away!

00:12:59.032 --> 00:13:01.816
I'll tell the truth, just stop this!

00:13:04.701 --> 00:13:06.882
I was tricked by Candy as well.

00:13:07.244 --> 00:13:10.532
She's a natural cheat!
And she's a thief, too!

00:13:10.756 --> 00:13:12.628
Neil, enough nonsense!

00:13:13.584 --> 00:13:14.799
Mother!

00:13:17.362 --> 00:13:23.041
You framed Candy for stealing, and now
she's going to Mexico for that!

00:13:23.615 --> 00:13:26.941
Neil, if you don't tell the truth,
it'll hurt you much, much more!

00:13:27.178 --> 00:13:28.995
Tell the truth!

00:13:29.108 --> 00:13:30.503
Stop!

00:13:30.538 --> 00:13:31.856
Will you tell the truth then?

00:13:32.407 --> 00:13:34.813
It was your and Eliza's doing, after all.

00:13:34.848 --> 00:13:35.877
You wanted to frame her?

00:13:37.057 --> 00:13:41.101
Then, you'll tell the truth to aunt
Elroy first thing in the morning!

00:13:41.287 --> 00:13:44.186
Do you swear on the honour of the
Adley family?

00:13:46.736 --> 00:13:49.050
She's supposed to be leaving
in the morning.

00:13:49.644 --> 00:13:52.322
We'll see you again tomorrow!

00:14:17.431 --> 00:14:21.395
Candy! Candy!
Wake up, Candy!

00:14:26.211 --> 00:14:28.508
They're here to pick you up, Candy.

00:14:29.101 --> 00:14:30.483
To pick me up?

00:14:30.646 --> 00:14:33.240
Yes. Take your things.

00:14:34.338 --> 00:14:36.531
But I was supposed to leave in the morning...

00:14:36.811 --> 00:14:40.316
What? They've already come
to pick her up?

00:14:40.514 --> 00:14:42.404
That's right, Brother.

00:14:48.858 --> 00:14:50.774
What's the matter, Brother?

00:14:51.154 --> 00:14:53.910
Anthony and the others are in for a
big surprise! Can't wait to see them!

00:15:03.243 --> 00:15:05.819
The time of my departure came
so soon.

00:15:06.198 --> 00:15:09.921
I don't have the time to bid
my farewell to Anthony.

00:15:16.959 --> 00:15:19.624
Farewell, Caesar, Cleopatra!

00:15:23.682 --> 00:15:24.832
Anthony!

00:15:35.745 --> 00:15:39.117
I'm sorry to have woken up
you so early, madam.

00:15:39.152 --> 00:15:41.298
I got here sooner than I planned.

00:15:41.333 --> 00:15:43.384
It's okay. You were in a hurry.

00:15:43.419 --> 00:15:44.124
Yes.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.389
This is Candy.
Look after her.

00:15:47.424 --> 00:15:48.699
As you please.

00:15:50.328 --> 00:15:51.403
She's little.

00:15:51.438 --> 00:15:55.471
And that suitcase... I can't use her
if she's just gonna mope around like that!

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:58.413
Bye, Candy.

00:15:58.792 --> 00:16:00.455
Don't come back.

00:16:01.344 --> 00:16:02.227
Now.

00:16:11.293 --> 00:16:13.062
What's this thing?

00:16:13.286 --> 00:16:15.610
It's a raccoon. Take it away, too.

00:16:15.698 --> 00:16:17.058
This thing?

00:16:21.458 --> 00:16:22.999
Caesar and Cleopatra!

00:16:26.414 --> 00:16:29.971
Horses understood that
Candy is going to Mexico!

00:16:30.006 --> 00:16:34.163
Mr. Hoittman, I don't
want to watch this!

00:16:35.495 --> 00:16:36.640
Mary!

00:17:10.923 --> 00:17:12.809
I'm finally leaving Leagan's estate.

00:17:13.789 --> 00:17:15.663
I've had many unpleasant moments here.

00:17:16.331 --> 00:17:18.462
But I've also had so many
wonderful times!

00:17:20.018 --> 00:17:24.245
Farewell, Dorothy, Doug, Mary, mr. Hoittman!

00:17:29.438 --> 00:17:31.905
I couldn't meet you in the end.

00:17:32.419 --> 00:17:34.427
Farewell Archie, Stear...

00:17:39.243 --> 00:17:40.593
...Anthony.

00:18:12.091 --> 00:18:14.070
Neil, I came back like I promised!

00:18:14.105 --> 00:18:15.173
Yeah, I waited for you.

00:18:16.685 --> 00:18:20.174
But I think you turned up a bit late.
Candy is already gone!

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:21.133
What?

00:18:21.337 --> 00:18:23.143
She's already far from here!

00:18:23.144 --> 00:18:23.769
What?

00:18:25.147 --> 00:18:27.936
Left already? Wasn't she supposed
to leave in the morning?

00:18:28.033 --> 00:18:30.282
If you don't believe me, you
can check the barn for yourself.

00:18:42.617 --> 00:18:43.558
Anthony!

00:18:45.597 --> 00:18:50.373
You're going after her!
But Candy will not come back!

00:19:00.051 --> 00:19:02.177
No good! I can't see them anywhere!

00:19:04.274 --> 00:19:05.384
Candy.

00:19:08.336 --> 00:19:10.194
I wanted to see you, until the very end.

00:19:55.857 --> 00:19:57.682
The sound of bagpipes!

00:20:03.871 --> 00:20:07.218
Where...
Where is it coming from?

00:20:11.239 --> 00:20:14.553
Anthony, Archie, Stear...

00:20:23.415 --> 00:20:24.526
Candy.

00:20:25.179 --> 00:20:27.953
Don't cry, Anthony!
Continue playing!

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:34.537
Candy, you're going to Mexico, after all.
If so...

00:20:36.368 --> 00:20:37.307
If so...!

00:20:50.332 --> 00:20:53.220
Hey, sit still!
You'll make me angry!

00:20:59.221 --> 00:21:03.142
Farewell, Anthony, Stear, Archie.

00:21:04.537 --> 00:21:10.697
Hailed by the sound of bagpipes,
Candy set on a journey to Mexico.

00:21:14.113 --> 00:21:20.126
To be continued...
